      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8708920::web::019::3_4_the_temperature_dependence_yield_str"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing temperature makes dislocation motion easier by reducing resistance to dislocation motion and increasing the available movement modes.",
